algorithms.pseudocode:
Algorithm: three_cube_residue_count(k, n)
Input: k in Z, n >= 1
Output: #{(a,b,c) in (Z/nZ)^3 : a^3+b^3+c^3 = k mod n}

count = 0
for a = 0 to n-1:
    for b = 0 to n-1:
        for c = 0 to n-1:
            if (a^3 + b^3 + c^3) mod n == k mod n:
                count += 1
return count

Complexity: O(n^3) time, O(1) space
